  <item>
    <title>硬件软件服务全涨价 以后还玩得起游戏吗【一周旧闻评论】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1bac877460cabdeb5888d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1bac877460cabdeb5888d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 03:56:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>SteamDeck价格暴涨40%，经历4月的年费上调后，PSN月费本月向上微调，NS2/NS主机和服务也悄悄涨价。硬件亏本软件赚钱的主机商业模式还能否继续，电子游戏还是最有性价比的娱乐方式吗。</span></p><p><span>本期出场：新手小乌贼，柯泽林雾，LV6</span></p><p><span>本期歌单：The Slopes of the Blessure - The Witcher 3</span></p><p><span>本期听点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a> SD掌机涨价 高配版近千美元依然被疯抢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">00:16:30</a> NS2硬件和服务迎来全面涨价</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">00:27:53</a> PSN月费季费向上微调</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">00:37:56</a> 多重成本压力下 主机商业模式还能否维持</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2646">00:44:06</a> 巫师3第三个资料片2027年推出</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2919">00:48:39</a> 现代战争4新预告蚌埠住了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3097">00:51:37</a> 现在最好玩的007游戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3455">00:57:35</a> DQ12八年后迎来重启</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/638ff28a00d7ad923d6f90c7/loJjAxgdGrHP1TWdNdRJX9wDqVCW.m4a" length="76528626" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniYujTA5jNihedw0gso7XT0xCXA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
