    <guid isPermaLink="false">690f574fd99642be96159f7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Nov 2025 14:48:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>3A游戏代名词GTA6第二次延期，任天堂和SE半年度财报透露哪些信息，Xbox年末新广告为何激怒玩家，录新闻有没有搞头，聊天室何去何从……一起来听本周节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期出场：新手小乌贼，柯泽林雾，LV6</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期歌单：萦音前词 - 杜玉白</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS：本期聊的新闻没有合适的曲子做开头，就选了首今年我印象最深刻的游戏插曲，出自《无限暖暖》「花焰季」过场，词曲钱晏，演唱吴嘉雯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期听点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">00:01:46</a> 发售越晚 发售越早 GTA6再次延期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">00:20:45</a> 2025金摇杆提名 聊聊你的年度游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">00:28:33</a> 《宝可梦Z/A》DLC新预告解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2321">00:38:41</a> NS2销量超预期 任天堂收入大涨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">00:50:35</a> 新游戏表现疲软 SE半死不活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3562">00:59:22</a> 何故作死？Xbox又出神广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4936">01:22:16</a> PSP支持云游戏 但港服没有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5502">01:31:42</a> 为什么会有玩家聊天室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6292">01:44:52</a> 今后的节目怎么录</span></p>]]></description>
